    ["<Assistant_Title1>【黄金梦土】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷展台\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得黄金梦土，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容-灵幻祭坛商店</>中使用灵幻牌兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Golden Dreamland】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Showcase\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Golden Dreamland. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Showcase</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Spirit Illusion Cards in the <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation - Spirit Illusion Altar Shop</>",
