    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>保护胜点</>\n正常完成对局即可获得一定的保护胜点，保护胜点可以<Highlight>抵扣</>对局失败时扣除的胜点。\n原有保护胜点：<Highlight>%s</>\n本局获得保护胜点：<Highlight>%s</>\n本局应扣除胜点：<Highlight>%s</>\n当前剩余保护胜点：<Highlight>%s</>"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Protection Points </> \n You can obtain a certain amount of protection points by completing matches normally. Protection points can <Highlight> offset </> the points deducted when a match is lost. \n Original Protection Points: <Highlight> %s </> \n Protection Points Obtained This Match: <Highlight> %s </> \n Points That Should Be Deducted This Match: <Highlight> %s </> \n Current Remaining Protection Points: <Highlight> %s </>",
    ["Following 贝丝·加德纳"] = "Following Beth Gardner",
    ["“格尔曼同款狼鱼罐头”！"] = "\"Gehrman-style Wolf-Fish Canned Food\"!",
    ["……好吧，你有成为政客的潜力。"] = "...Well, you have the potential to be a politician.",
    ["　　<Hide stylename=\"InvDefault_HW\" id=\"#157\">我不想死在这里我想回到贝克兰德当街头画家我很想家我很想家我很想家谁能救救我</>\n　　<InvDefault_HW>冷，饿</>\n　　<Hide stylename=\"InvDefault_HW\" id=\"#161\">我害了所有人，我不配当队长，对不起所有人我让你们白白去死了我犯了杀人的罪我太懦弱了我搞砸了所有</>\n　　<InvDefault_HW>对不起，兄弟们</>\n　　<InvHighlight>（日记到此为止。不过每隔几页都有士兵们的速写，有的在睡觉，有的在举枪瞄准，姿态生动，看得出绘画功底深厚。）</>"] = "<Hide stylename=\"InvDefault_HW\" id=\"#157\"> I don't want to die here I want to go back to Backlund to be a street painter I miss home so much I miss home so much I miss home so much who can save me </> \n <InvDefault_HW> Cold, hungry </> \n <Hide stylename=\"InvDefault_HW\" id=\"#161\"> I harmed everyone, I am not fit to be a captain, I'm sorry to everyone I let you die in vain I committed the crime of murder I was too cowardly I messed everything up </> \n <InvDefault_HW> I'm sorry, brothers </> \n <InvHighlight> (The diary ends here. However, every few pages there are sketches of soldiers, some sleeping, some aiming their guns, the poses are vivid, showing a deep foundation in drawing.) </>",
    ["　　我成为了一位“通识者”，靠着魔药的力量，我竟然完整回想起了以前学过的知识，物理，化学，等等，等等。​\n　　不仅回想起，我还深刻地理解和掌握了它们，哈哈，这简直是为我这个异域来客量身定做的“职业”嘛，能最大化地发挥我的优势！不得不说，如果我以这样的状态回去，回到高三，一定能成为状元，要是再有更规范更深入的专业学习，科学家不算太困难的目标。​"] = "I became a \"Savant.\" Relying on the power of the potion, I actually recalled all the knowledge I had learned before—physics, chemistry, and so on. \n Not only did I recall them, but I also deeply understood and mastered them. Haha, this is simply a \"profession\" tailor-made for an outsider like me; it maximizes my advantages! I must say, if I went back in this state, back to my senior year of high school, I would definitely become the top scholar. If I had more standardized and in-depth professional training, becoming a scientist wouldn't be too difficult a goal.",
